---
title: "Installer destination lifecycle"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Blocked
    lg1: In progress
  }
  class lg0 orange
  class lg1 blue
  s0: Waiting to check - destination unchanged
  s1: Checking destinations - destination unchanged
  s2: Blocked by conflict - destination unchanged
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: check all destinations
  s1 --> s2: reject conflicting install
  class s0 blue
  class s1 blue
  class s2 orange
